<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "Open a P2P Session with another user: a single persistent peer-to-peer connection that hosts every feature at once — an audio or video call, file transfers, and games — all running at the same time."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_code}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Syntax")}</.help_h4>
<pre>{dgettext("help_commands", "/p2p <nickname>")}</pre>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tag}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Parameters")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <code>nickname</code> {dgettext("help_commands", "— The user to open a P2P Session with.")}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_control}>{dgettext("help_commands", "How It Works")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext("help_commands", "Running")} <code>{dgettext("help_commands", "/p2p")}</code>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "creates the session and writes the request straight into your private message with that person. Nothing is asked of you first. The line carries the session's own address and draws a card, and that card is the door for both of you — the other side opens the same one, or presses Decline beside it. Following it opens the session in a browser tab of its own, starting in the room where you both pick devices and press Ready. Once the host presses Start, Call, Files, Games and Stats all run over the one connection; ending one keeps the others alive."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Rules & Limits")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext("help_commands", "Both you and the target must be registered and identified (via")} <code>{dgettext("help_commands", "/ns identify")}</code>).
  </li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_commands", "The target must be online.")}</li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_commands", "You cannot start a P2P session with yourself.")}</li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_commands",
      "You can hold sessions with several people at once. Only a second session with the same person is refused."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Examples")}</.help_h4>
<pre>{dgettext("help_commands", "/p2p Alice /p2p Bob")}</pre>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_commands", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="feature-p2p-in-chat">
    {dgettext("help_commands", "P2P Sessions in Chat")}
  </.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-p2p-starting-room">
    {dgettext("help_commands", "P2P Starting Room")}
  </.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-universal-lobby">
    {dgettext("help_commands", "P2P Session")}
  </.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="feature-video-call">{dgettext("help_commands", "Video Call")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-file-transfer">
    {dgettext("help_commands", "File Transfer")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
